  "extractionNotes": "Fixed-term employment 2024-11-04..2025-12-27, ending on the birth date (contract extended to the birth; the KP mechanism is implied, not cited). Large employer (>20 insured) paid sick pay (2025-04-03..04 and 2025-05-12..06-11, codes A/B), pregnancy sickness benefit 2025-06-12..2025-12-26 and one day of maternity benefit on 2025-12-27 at 100% = 150.11 (employer remark), implying a base of 4503.30; ZUS added title 1240 from 2025-12-28 and took over. Handwritten ZUS note: right to maternity benefit granted. The Z-3 salary rows legible are 2024-11..2025-03 (fixed 5698.80, 5278.80 in March, plus variable 147.24 / 294.48 / 543.83); they do not reproduce 4503.30 with the standard rule (likely partial-month actual pay), so no base is asserted. The one-day payment at 100% predates the 81.5% choice on the ZAM (full-use box) and is recorded as inferred."
